---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../lib/siteConfig";
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer" description={`Disclaimer for ${siteConfig.name}.`} noIndex>
	<Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: "Disclaimer" }]} />

	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Disclaimer</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-neutral mt-8 max-w-none prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-ink prose-p:text-body prose-li:text-body dark:prose-invert">
			<p>
				The information provided on {siteConfig.name} is for educational and informational
				purposes only. We are not financial advisors, investment advisors, legal advisors, or tax
				professionals. The content published on this website should not be considered financial or
				investment advice.
			</p>
			<h2>No professional advice</h2>
			<p>
				All readers are encouraged to conduct their own research and consult qualified
				professionals before making any financial, investment, trading, or legal decisions. Any
				actions taken based on the information provided on this website are strictly at the
				reader's own risk.
			</p>
			<h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
			<p>
				While we strive to provide accurate and updated information, {siteConfig.name} makes no
				guarantees regarding the completeness, reliability, or accuracy of any information
				published. Financial markets and regulations are constantly changing, and information may
				become outdated over time.
			</p>
			<h2>Investment risk</h2>
			<p>
				Investing and trading involve risks, including potential loss of capital. Past performance
				does not guarantee future results. Readers should carefully assess their financial
				situation and risk tolerance before making investment decisions.
			</p>
			<h2>External links</h2>
			<p>
				This website may contain links to external websites for additional information or
				references. We are not responsible for the content, policies, or practices of any
				third-party websites.
			</p>
			<h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
			<p>
				Some pages may contain affiliate links. If readers purchase products or services through
				these links, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to the user.
			</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about this disclaimer? <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-primary">Contact us</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
